{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fofumia",
    "steam_appid": 3459570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/c61e4c8485ee00996d24e686ff142343.avif?t=1749440087\" width=500 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fofumia is a cozy and adorable puzzle game where your challenge is to tidy up the mess made by your Fofuno while completing various small tasks. But that\u2019s not all... your Fofuno also needs care! Feed, play, and shower them with affection as you organize the rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SETTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fofumia, you take care of the cutest cat breed in the entire world: the Fofunos! These one-eyed cats are not only adorable, but they also love to play, explore, and don\u2019t mind being alone. However, they are quite clumsy, which makes them all the more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.poster.avif?t=1749440087\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.webm?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.mp4?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the items and match them to their silhouettes, but don\u2019t forget the Fofunos! They also need your attention. Sometimes they\u2019re affectionate, sometimes hyperactive, or they simply love to get in the way while you're cleaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy these lovable little creatures as you explore and organize a variety of spaces in a relaxing puzzle game with a touch of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 levels in different locations all over the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 items to organize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, play and take care of your Fofuno</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level a short story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming illustration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/ddd96aa8f45265fbb332bb3e97ec0e45.poster.avif?t=1749440087\" width=200 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/ddd96aa8f45265fbb332bb3e97ec0e45.webm?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/c61e4c8485ee00996d24e686ff142343.avif?t=1749440087\" width=500 height=182 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fofumia is a cozy and adorable puzzle game where your challenge is to tidy up the mess made by your Fofuno while completing various small tasks. But that\u2019s not all... your Fofuno also needs care! Feed, play, and shower them with affection as you organize the rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SETTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fofumia, you take care of the cutest cat breed in the entire world: the Fofunos! These one-eyed cats are not only adorable, but they also love to play, explore, and don\u2019t mind being alone. However, they are quite clumsy, which makes them all the more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.poster.avif?t=1749440087\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.webm?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/e81eab0388482c610090f64d0419da40.mp4?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the items and match them to their silhouettes, but don\u2019t forget the Fofunos! They also need your attention. Sometimes they\u2019re affectionate, sometimes hyperactive, or they simply love to get in the way while you're cleaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy these lovable little creatures as you explore and organize a variety of spaces in a relaxing puzzle game with a touch of chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 levels in different locations all over the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1000 items to organize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, play and take care of your Fofuno</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level a short story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming illustration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/ddd96aa8f45265fbb332bb3e97ec0e45.poster.avif?t=1749440087\" width=200 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459570/extras/ddd96aa8f45265fbb332bb3e97ec0e45.webm?t=1749440087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Fofumia! Clean up the mess left by the adorable Fofunos - playful, hyperactive one-eyed kittens who love scattering toys and objects everywhere. It\u2019s up to you to set everything straight...",
